    "representation": "The pinned source's 12,956 unsolved rune indices are key material; English targets are converted to GP rune indices and the hard-coded byte target is reduced modulo 29.",
    "procedure": "Use the source beam decoder with up to three key skips and its English quadgram score. Sweep five targets, four LP2 key variants and two signs at offset zero; compare the selected top five with 200 target-order shuffles each.",
    "parameters": "40 source decodes (some arithmetically equivalent); 500-rune cap on the three English-text targets, 63-byte numeric target, 200-rune LP2 prefix target; beam width 400; 100 shuffles for the planted control.",
    "exclusions": "Absent pp49–51 payload, other key offsets, other targets and encodings, alternative boundary rules or skip models, and the reverse use of other objects as keys."
